  "question": {
    "text": "Let $S_1=\\{z \\in C:|z| \\leq 5\\}, S_2=\\left\\{z \\in C: \\operatorname{Im}\\left(\\frac{z+1-\\sqrt{3} i}{1-\\sqrt{3} i}\\right) \\geq 0\\right\\}$ and $S_3=\\{z \\in C: \\operatorname{Re}(z) \\geq 0\\}$. Then the area of the region $S_1 \\cap S_2 \\cap S_3$ is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Q5Egc",
      "text": "$\\frac{125 \\pi}{12}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "bDuVV",
      "text": "$\\frac{125 \\pi}{4}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "y7Fmc",
      "text": "$\\frac{125 \\pi}{24}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8waEi",
      "text": "$\\frac{125 \\pi}{6}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$S_1: x^2+y^2 \\leq 25...(1)$\n$\\begin{aligned} & S_2: \\operatorname{lm} \\text { of } \\frac{z+(1-\\sqrt{3} i)}{(1-\\sqrt{3} i)} \\geq 0 \\\\ & \\operatorname{lm} \\text { of }\\left(\\frac{x+i y}{1-\\sqrt{3} i}+1\\right) \\geq 0 \\\\ & \\operatorname{lm} \\text { of }\\left(\\frac{(x+i y)(1+\\sqrt{3} i)}{4}\\right) \\geq 0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{3} x+y \\geq 0 ...(2)\\\\ & S_3: x \\geq 0 ...(3)\\\\ & \\text { Area }=\\frac{5}{12}\\left(\\pi(5)^2\\right)\\end{aligned}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/H4vdqHJiqR70dn4Bv8tsNJWS2YnLcgsojEe2KJvZQX0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
